  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Imperative of you",
   "texto": [
    "With **tu**, the imperative is almost equal to the form of «ele»: **Fala** (spoke), **come** (come), **vem** (ven), **diz** (di), **dá** (da).",
    "Derogation: **ser** → **sê** (know). **Estar** → **está** (is)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Pronombres behind the verb",
   "texto": [
    "With the affirmative imperative, the pronoun goes **detrás** with script: **Diz-me** (tell me), **Dá-me** (give me), **Diz-lhe** (tell him), **Vai-te** (go).",
    "Eye: **Faz-lo** does not exist: **fá-lo** is written (do it) because the verb lost the -z."
   ]
